# THE ORACLE JUDGE, AS PROTECTED CONFIG: a ModernCI tool pin (backend `tools:` entry
# busbar-oracle-judge, key .ci/oracle-judge.pin). The ModernCI daemon downloads it OUTSIDE any run,
# with its forge credential (the release is private), checks the sha256 for the backend's arch,
# and gives checks only the path, in $BUSBAR_ORACLE_JUDGE_PATH. No check ever holds the token.
# These are busbar-release dev-bin's assets (asset ids: GitHub serves a private asset only from the
# API URL, as octet-stream). aarch64 is the judge for BUSBAR_ORACLE_RELEASE_REF
# 00aee90be0847fe17163efe6565acfb647237bd0 (busbar-release #441 + #443: precise `values` acceptance, on
# top of #434/#435's dist/default candidate), built by ModernCI (busbar-release judge-bin-aarch64, static musl) because
# busbar-release's GitHub Actions is down for billing; unsigned (no .sig) until re-signed with the
# release key. x86_64 stays the 151ad095 judge: ModernCI compute is aarch64 only and no x86_64 build of
# d12a08c7 exists. Each sha256 equals BUSBAR_ORACLE_SHA256_LINUX_<arch> in .ci/*.yaml, verified against
# the downloaded assets 2026-10-26. Not a branch file (not .yaml).
url:
  x86_64: https://api.github.com/repos/GetBusbar/busbar-release/releases/assets/660620261
  aarch64: https://api.github.com/repos/GetBusbar/busbar-release/releases/assets/683369818
sha256:
  x86_64: 0f6c0433bc2089af5a8958b5e2e237c86c065b15c38e015225fa3faf4ab6f0e8
  aarch64: 09e2bdb10da505aa07ea422a2be9307613a2637cd12bc86f6e8e1c0773cf6845
path: busbar-oracle
auth: forge
accept: application/octet-stream
